  m_Name: NPC_95_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Hello, doctor. I'm hot, short of breath, and feel terribly sick.\nMy heart keeps racing even when I sit as still as I can.\nI don't know what's wrong. I felt well enough to go out this morning."
